DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     A special file mode, called the _s_t_i_c_k_y _b_i_t (mode S_ISTXT), is used to in‐
     dicate special treatment for directories.  It is ignored for regular
     files.  See chmod(2) or the file <_s_y_s_/_s_t_a_t_._h> for an explanation of file
